Welcome to Krypton!  (level 0 -> 1)
===================================
The file "krypton1" in this directory holds the password for the next level.
It is not encrypted - it is only ENCODED. Encoding just changes how data is
represented; anyone who recognises the format can reverse it.

Hint : look at the character set. A-Z a-z 0-9 + / and maybe '=' at the end?
Tools: base64, man base64

When you have the password:   ssh krypton1@localhost
